      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Vision Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End the activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アクティビティを終了する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone remains in the activity except you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "他の方はアクティビティに残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone will leave the activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "他の方もアクティビティから離れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開始の仕方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you launch this application during FaceTime, you can start an activity. When you start an activity, the callers automatically join an activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FaceTime中にこのアプリを立ち上げると、アクティビティを起動することが出来ます。誰かがSharePlayを開始すると、通話相手は自動的にSharePlayに参加します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you want to join a SharePlay session that has already started, you can do so from the Control Center." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "もし既に通話相手がSharePlayを開始している場合は、コントロールセンターから参加できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In visionOS 26, You can share spatial experiences with other Apple Vision Pro users in the same room." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "visionOS 26から同じ部屋にいる近くのApple Vision Proユーザーとアプリ体験を共有できるようになりました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "invalidated, (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無効(%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join SharePlay" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SharePlayに参加する"
          }
        }
      }
